    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tezzel</strong> is a cozy, colorful, and deeply challenging puzzle game where every move shapes a masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Mateu, an aging tilemaker in 1910 Barcelona, as he restores his reputation by completing a grand tile wall for the great master Gaud\u00ed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/27c9326b2f249b344e8175a726d034b3.avif?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilemaking is an intricate art that requires precision, planning, and problem-solving. You\u2019ll need to experiment, analyse, and think ahead to complete each tile and master the craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/ad4688d63efc7b0e49458421048fa2bd.poster.avif?t=1753818108\" width=800 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/ad4688d63efc7b0e49458421048fa2bd.webm?t=1753818108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new tilemaking tools that introduce unique mechanics. Discover 10 tools across 100+ handcrafted levels, each with their own puzzling twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/4690b549b22cf3a956f6eec910c5e01e.poster.avif?t=1753818108\" width=800 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/4690b549b22cf3a956f6eec910c5e01e.webm?t=1753818108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/315e339cd829f29e24741394f0717a7b.poster.avif?t=1753818108\" width=800 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/315e339cd829f29e24741394f0717a7b.webm?t=1753818108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/89ed095ed7849a41ad1a5d992d373176.poster.avif?t=1753818108\" width=800 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/89ed095ed7849a41ad1a5d992d373176.webm?t=1753818108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each solved puzzle adds a new tile to Mateu\u2019s masterpiece. Watch the wall transform from an empty canvas to a vibrant work of art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/f4ff77c725c7942b99d8ab21850bac08.avif?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=466 /></span><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Mindbending Mechanics:</strong> Discover new tilemaking tools that start out simple and build up into confounding conundrums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Handcrafted Puzzles</strong>: Each level is thoughtfully designed to challenge and delight with no filler, just elegant and clever puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Progression:</strong> if one puzzle stumps you, explore others and find your own way through the wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribute to Tile Artistry</strong>: Enjoy colorful pixel art and a serene soundtrack that transport you to early 20th-century Barcelona</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 Can you help Mateu finish his masterpiece, one tile at a time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/3b1811404dd94b7295e2d40a5096ba0a.avif?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tezzel</strong> is a cozy, colorful, and deeply challenging puzzle game where every move shapes a masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Mateu, an aging tilemaker in 1910 Barcelona, as he restores his reputation by completing a grand tile wall for the great master Gaud\u00ed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/27c9326b2f249b344e8175a726d034b3.avif?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/8a4139b7accbd59fcff764a445680a78.webp?t=1753818108\" width=711 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilemaking is an intricate art that requires precision, planning, and problem-solving. You\u2019ll need to experiment, analyse, and think ahead to complete each tile and master the craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/ad4688d63efc7b0e49458421048fa2bd.poster.avif?t=1753818108\" width=800 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/ad4688d63efc7b0e494584